16:01.260 --> 16:03.760
<b>Odd circumstances have
led up to this meeting,</b>

16:03.760 --> 16:05.460
<b>but you don't mind, do you?</b>

16:05.460 --> 16:07.630
<b>I have no objections.</b>

16:07.630 --> 16:09.300
<b>I'm going to warn you ahead of time.</b>

16:09.300 --> 16:12.000
<b>I feel like we can win this today.</b>

16:12.000 --> 16:13.800
<b>Okay, here we go, Shien!</b>

16:15.900 --> 16:21.240
<b>Well, it seems that, thanks to you,
I'll get a good workout today.</b>

16:32.890 --> 16:34.350
<b>Prepare yourself!</b>

16:40.160 --> 16:41.630
<b>We got him?</b>

16:46.600 --> 16:47.540
<b>Tenpou...</b>

16:47.540 --> 16:48.100
<b>Hakkai!
Tenpou...</b>

16:48.100 --> 16:49.000
<b>Hakkai!</b>

17:21.500 --> 17:23.130
<b>Son Goku...</b>

17:39.190 --> 17:41.180
<b>I see you've become even stronger.</b>

17:48.160 --> 17:51.830
<b>Well, you've allowed me to
get an excellent workout.</b>

17:51.830 --> 17:54.340
<b>Let's meet again.</b>

17:54.340 --> 17:57.200
<b>What the hell?! We were
just getting started!</b>

17:57.910 --> 18:00.640
<b>Damn it!</b>

18:06.680 --> 18:09.880
<b>Shien, I made a promise with him</b>

18:09.880 --> 18:12.650
<b>that I'd show him around the Heavens
when my wounds were healed.</b>

18:13.620 --> 18:17.490
<b>Prince Nataku, whom are
you referring to?</b>

18:17.490 --> 18:20.820
<b>Nameless, he said he
didn't have a name.</b>

18:22.600 --> 18:27.500
<b>Lord Nataku, will there come a
day when I, too, will understand</b>

18:27.500 --> 18:30.270
<b>why you loved that view so much?</b>

18:32.840 --> 18:34.210
<b>How was it?</b>

18:34.210 --> 18:34.340
<b>It was productive.
How was it?</b>

18:34.340 --> 18:36.330
<b>It was productive.</b>

18:38.380 --> 18:42.280
<b>These are... Son Goku did this?</b>

18:42.280 --> 18:44.020
<b>Yes...</b>

18:44.020 --> 18:46.280
<b>It seems the time has come, Homura.</b>

18:50.260 --> 18:52.850
<b>Yeah, it's time.</b>

18:55.060 --> 18:56.630
<b>It's mine now!</b>

18:56.630 --> 18:57.870
<b>Yay! Yay! Mine! Mine!</b>

18:57.870 --> 19:00.200
<b>Lady Lirin, how can you
be so shameless?!
Yay! Yay! Mine! Mine!</b>

19:00.200 --> 19:02.000
<b>You're such a dork, Sanzo!</b>

19:02.000 --> 19:03.900
<b>This one's mine too!</b>

19:03.900 --> 19:04.340
<b>Why's that brat still around?!</b>

19:04.340 --> 19:06.740
<b>Now, now, Sanzo, calm down.
Why's that brat still around?!</b>

19:06.740 --> 19:07.780
<b>Now, now, Sanzo, calm down.</b>

19:07.780 --> 19:12.210
<b>Since we were here, I thought we'd
stay and enjoy the festival.</b>

19:12.850 --> 19:17.080
<b>But I understand now,
having fought him.</b>

19:17.850 --> 19:21.410
<b>I've never met someone with
such absolute conviction.</b>

19:22.620 --> 19:25.890
<b>In all honestly, it made
me hesitate too.</b>

19:25.890 --> 19:29.060
<b>His strength is different from
Homura's or Zenon's</b>

19:29.060 --> 19:31.770
<b>at some fundamental level.</b>

19:31.770 --> 19:37.830
<b>If that's true, Shien may be
consumed with doubt at heart.</b>

19:39.470 --> 19:45.110
<b>Really strong guys tend to be
the complete opposite at heart.</b>

19:45.110 --> 19:46.580
<b>Do you think so?</b>

19:47.880 --> 19:50.080
<b>Aren't you guys aware
of it in yourselves?</b>

19:51.690 --> 19:55.620
<b>In your heart, there's
always doubt swirling about</b>

19:55.620 --> 19:58.960
<b>and you fight with all you've
got to shake that feeling off.</b>

19:59.860 --> 20:02.850
<b>That's how you've defeated
all those demons, right?</b>

20:04.200 --> 20:05.470
<b>Maybe so.</b>

20:05.470 --> 20:05.700
<b>But that goes for you, too,
doesn't it, Sanzo?
Maybe so.</b>

20:05.700 --> 20:07.930
<b>But that goes for you, too,
doesn't it, Sanzo?</b>

20:10.040 --> 20:12.010
<b>Why you! You ate it all, didn't you?!</b>

20:12.010 --> 20:13.870
<b>You're not getting away with it!</b>

20:15.480 --> 20:17.140
<b>Stop, you little...</b>

20:17.140 --> 20:21.850
<b>Do you think we can win
against those gods?</b>

20:21.850 --> 20:23.280
<b>Beats me.</b>

20:30.290 --> 20:31.760
<b>I see.</b>

20:32.660 --> 20:35.060
<b>This is very interesting data.</b>

20:46.140 --> 20:54.980
<b>Yukikau hito wa mina
omoi nimotsu seotte</b>

20:56.350 --> 21:06.750
<b>Touku ni yureru kagerou no
naka ni ashita o mitsukeru</b>

21:08.100 --> 21:18.230
<b>Kono te o kobore-ochiru
suna no you na kanjou</b>

21:19.570 --> 21:32.550
<b>Ano toki mune ni sasatta
kotoba ga fui ni uzuku kedo</b>

21:32.550 --> 21:44.000
<b>Hatenai yoru o kazoenagara
jibun no kakera sagashite ita</b>

21:44.000 --> 21:55.280
<b>Ushinau hodo ni kono omoi
ga tashika ni natteku</b>

21:55.280 --> 22:07.450
<b>Ima nara kitto aruite
yukeru doko made mo</b>
